---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms and conditions for using the Raising Impact website.">
  <Navbar />

  <section id="main-content" class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-[#0F2440]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-[#C09D4B] font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-4" >Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-white/50 text-sm font-inter">Last updated: March 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#F5F1E9]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="space-y-10 text-[#2D3A4A]/80 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing and using the Raising Impact website (raisingimpact.org), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our website.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >2. Use of Content</h2>
          <p>All research reports, articles, and content published on this website are the intellectual property of Raising Impact. You may:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C09D4B] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Download and read our open-access reports for personal or organizational use</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C09D4B] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Cite our research with proper attribution to Raising Impact</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#C09D4B] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Share links to our content</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">You may not reproduce, distribute, or commercially exploit our content without prior written consent.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >3. Advisory Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>Content on this website is for informational purposes only. Our research and publications do not constitute financial, legal, or investment advice. Philanthropic decisions should be made in consultation with qualified advisors.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >4. Accuracy</h2>
          <p>We strive for accuracy in all our research and publications. However, we make no warranties about the completeness or reliability of information on this website. Data and findings reflect the state of evidence at the time of publication.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >5. External Links</h2>
          <p>Our website may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of third-party sites.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >6. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-[#0F2440] mb-4" >7. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@raisingimpact.org" class="text-[#C09D4B] hover:underline">info@raisingimpact.org</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
